          "year": 2005,
          "date_decided": "2005-03-24",
          "holding": "The court held that section 1(D)(q) of the Adoption Act, which made a conviction for attempted murder or aggravated battery of a child conclusive proof of unfitness, denies equal protection because section 1(D)(i) lets parents convicted of comparable offenses rebut the presumption.",
